        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>劣质碳水VS优质碳水</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #cfe4f2 0%, #d9ecf0 35%, #cfe9d8 70%, #c9e6cf 100%);\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px 16px 30px 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background-image:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.35) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.35) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 12px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.35) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.35) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 12px);\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #2b3f8f;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 8px 0 22px 0;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #ffffff;\n    text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #ffffff;\n  }\n  .tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 3px solid #4a7a3a;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    color: #b0231f;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    padding: 4px 20px;\n    margin: 6px 0 12px 6px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .textcol {\n    flex: 0 0 300px;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .textcol .bullet { }\n  .imgcol {\n    flex: 0 0 195px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 4px;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 58px;\n    border: 1px dashed #8a8a8a;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #555;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .fulltext {\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .example {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 10px 22px 0 26px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .example.indent-mid {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">劣质碳水VS优质碳水</h1>\n\n  <!-- 劣质碳水 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"tag\">劣质碳水</div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"textcol\">\n        <div class=\"bullet\">·高热量、高糖分</div>\n        <div class=\"bullet\">·低纤维食物</div>\n        <div class=\"bullet\">·营养匮乏、高盐</div>\n        <div class=\"bullet\">·高饱和脂肪、含反式脂肪</div>\n        <div>经过精加工、纤维含量少的碳水化</div>\n        <div>合物；很容易转换成糖</div>\n        <div>分，因此容易被人体消化吸收、会</div>\n        <div>导致发胖</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"imgcol\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 冰淇淋]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 丸子]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 蛋糕]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 薯条]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 薯片]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 麻辣食物]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"example\">\n      比如：炸薯条、油条、薯片、油煎饼、酸辣粉、麻球、饼\n      <div class=\"indent-mid\" style=\"text-align:center;\">干、披萨饼、冰淇淋、糖果、马卡龙、奶油蛋糕...</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 优质碳水 -->\n  <div class=\"section\" style=\"margin-top:26px;\">\n    <div class=\"tag\">优质碳水</div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"textcol\">\n        <div class=\"bullet\">·低热量、低糖分</div>\n        <div class=\"bullet\">·高纤维食物</div>\n        <div class=\"bullet\">·营养丰富、低盐</div>\n        <div class=\"bullet\">·低饱和脂肪、无反式脂肪</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"imgcol\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 燕麦]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 糙米饭]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 谷物]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 紫薯]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 芋头]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 山药]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"fulltext\">\n      优质的碳水化合物又称慢碳水化合物，<br>\n      通常是指没有经过加工的、完整的碳水化合<br>\n      物，在人体内消化时间较长，延长饱腹感的<br>\n      同时，不会使血糖突然剧升。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"example\">\n      谷类：主要来自于粮食，如荞麦、燕麦、糙米、紫米、薏米等（谷类\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;\">中含有的是多糖的淀粉，不会造成血糖迅速地</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;\">升高）</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;\">薯类：主要是红薯、番薯、芋头、山药等。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
